   "html": "<div class='callout'><p><b>专业问题：</b>催化裂化多馏分收率相互牵制且响应非线性。</p><p><b>输入资料：</b>原料特征、反应温度、剂油比与回炼比。</p><p><b>服务目标：</b>预测馏分构成，并检查总量与物理边界。</p></div><svg viewBox='0 0 720 250' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' role='img' aria-label='FCC 反应再生系统与产物分布'><text x='20' y='20' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>催化裂化：重油在催化剂上「一分为六」</text><rect x='95' y='85' width='24' height='115' rx='4' fill='#f6ebe1' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='107' y='78' font-size='9.5' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>提升管反应器</text><ellipse cx='185' cy='120' rx='38' ry='28' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='185' y='86' font-size='9.5' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>再生器</text><line x1='14' y1='185' x2='90' y2='185' stroke='#d47a3a' stroke-width='1.6' marker-end='url(#arR1)'/><text x='16' y='176' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a'>新鲜原料</text><line x1='185' y1='215' x2='185' y2='152' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.4' marker-end='url(#arR1)'/><text x='192' y='200' font-size='9' fill='#41699b'>空气</text><line x1='119' y1='100' x2='145' y2='110' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3' marker-end='url(#arR1)'/><text x='121' y='93' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>待生剂</text><path d='M170,148 L170,170 L121,170' fill='none' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='1.2' stroke-dasharray='4 3' marker-end='url(#arR1)'/><text x='138' y='163' font-size='8.5' fill='#64748b'>再生剂</text><path d='M107,85 L107,45 L252,45 L252,56' fill='none' stroke='#2875c7' stroke-width='1.6' marker-end='url(#arR1)'/><text x='150' y='38' font-size='9' fill='#2875c7'>油气</text><rect x='252' y='58' width='46' height='142' rx='8' fill='#e9eef5' stroke='#41699b' stroke-width='1.5'/><text x='275' y='214' font-size='9.5' fill='#41699b' text-anchor='middle'>分馏塔</text><line x1='340' y1='25' x2='340' y2='225' stroke='#dfe6f0' stroke-width='1'/><text x='355' y='30' font-size='11' font-weight='600' fill='#202b38'>产物分布（占原料质量分数，典型值）</text><rect x='360' y='50' width='10.9' height='26' fill='#41699b'/><rect x='370.9' y='50' width='49.6' height='26' fill='#d47a3a'/><rect x='420.5' y='50' width='171.4' height='26' fill='#2875c7'/><rect x='591.9' y='50' width='58.5' height='26' fill='#708060'/><rect x='650.4' y='50' width='28.2' height='26' fill='#9ba3a9'/><rect x='678.6' y='50' width='21.4' height='26' fill='#b05a51'/><line x1='365' y1='76' x2='365' y2='92' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='.8'/><text x='358' y='103' font-size='9' fill='#41699b'>干气 3.2</text><line x1='395' y1='76' x2='395' y2='112' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='.8'/><text x='393' y='124' font-size='9' fill='#d47a3a' text-anchor='middle'>液化气 14.6</text><line x1='506' y1='76' x2='506' y2='92' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='.8'/><text x='506' y='103' font-size='9' fill='#2875c7' text-anchor='middle'>汽油 50.4</text><line x1='621' y1='76' x2='621' y2='112' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='.8'/><text x='621' y='124' font-size='9' fill='#708060' text-anchor='middle'>柴油 17.2</text><line x1='664' y1='76' x2='664' y2='92' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='.8'/><text x='664' y='103' font-size='9' fill='#64748b' text-anchor='middle'>油浆 8.3</text><line x1='689' y1='76' x2='689' y2='112' stroke='#9ba3a9' stroke-width='.8'/><text x='683' y='124' font-size='9' fill='#b05a51' text-anchor='middle'>焦炭 6.3</text><text x='355' y='152' font-size='9.5' fill='#d47a3a'>温度 +10°C：汽油先升后降，干气 ↑↑，柴油/油浆 ↓</text><text x='355' y='170' font-size='9.5' fill='#41699b'>剂油比 ↑ 或回炼比 ↓：转化更深，油浆更少、干气更多</text><text x='355' y='196' font-size='9.5' fill='#64748b'>经验关联式 20+ 参数，原料一换就要重新标定（数周）</text><text x='20' y='234' font-size='9' fill='#64748b'>反应温度 505—530°C · 剂油比 6—8 · 再生温度约 700°C · 焦炭在再生器烧掉供出热量</text><defs><marker id='arR1' markerWidth='7' markerHeight='7' refX='5' refY='3.5' orient='auto'><path d='M0,0 L7,3.5 L0,7 Z' fill='#64748b'/></marker></defs></svg><div class='figcap'><b>专业原理示意</b><span>用于解释业务概念和空间、参数关系；图中数字与对照为教学示意，不是现场成果。</span></div>"
