   "html": "<p>本地演示无需接入现场。下面的数据清单用于说明这一业务的资料要求，不表示项目已取得这些实测资料。</p><p>这套数据 <b>炼厂 DCS 和 LIMS 里都有</b>，采集本身不花钱；工作量集中在<b>对齐与清洗</b>——把秒级操作、小时级工况、班级化验三种时间尺度拧成一张表，并把原料切换等过渡期样本挑出来。</p><div class='checklist'><div class='cl-head'><span>数据准备清单 · 4 项</span><span class='cl-prog'><span id='cl-txt'>0 / 4</span><span class='cl-bar'><i id='cl-fill'></i></span></span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='0'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>原料与操作参数</span><span class='cl-s'>密度、残炭、掺渣比、反应温度、剂油比、回炼比，小时级</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，需稳态筛选</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='1'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>产品分布化验</span><span class='cl-s'>干气—油浆五馏分收率 + 焦炭，每班 1—2 次</span></span><span class='cl-n'>天然标签，需与操作时段对齐</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='2'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>运行工况</span><span class='cl-s'>再生温度、催化剂活性与使用天数</span></span><span class='cl-n'>无需标注，作为辅助特征</span></div><div class='cl-item' data-cl='3'><span class='cl-box'><svg width='10' height='10' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#fff' stroke-width='4' stroke-linecap='round' stroke-linejoin='round'><path d='M4 12.5l5 5L20 6.5'/></svg></span><span><span class='cl-t'>操作变更记录</span><span class='cl-s'>原料切换、切断进料、换剂的时间点</span></span><span class='cl-n'>用于标记过渡期样本</span></div></div>"
